<h1 class="page-title">RequestDependencyPlugin</h1>
<p class="page-lead">Holds lower-priority requests in the queue while CRITICAL or HIGH priority requests are in flight. Ensures checkout flows, auth calls, and urgent writes always preempt background polling.</p>

